  /// request was successful but the capacity provisioning is still pending.
  /// failed - The Capacity Reservation request has failed. A request can fail
  /// due to request parameters that are not valid, capacity constraints, or
  /// instance limit constraints. You can view a failed request for 60
  /// minutes. scheduled - ( Future-dated Capacity Reservations ) The
