  /// start date and time. unsupported - ( Future-dated Capacity Reservations
  /// ) Amazon EC2 can't support the future-dated Capacity Reservation request
  /// due to capacity constraints. You can view unsupported requests for 30
  /// days. The Capacity Reservation will not be delivered. cancelling - (
  /// Future-dated Capacity Reservations ) The Capacity Reservation is being
