  /// being advertised. deprovisioned - The CIDR has been deprovisioned.
  /// failed-deprovision - Deprovisioning failed. failed-provision -
  /// Provisioning failed. pending-deprovision - Deprovisioning is in
  /// progress. pending-provision - Provisioning is in progress. provisioned -
  /// The CIDR is provisioned. provisioned-not-publicly-advertisable - The
