  /// rebalance notification. You can terminate the old instances, or you can
  /// leave them running. You are charged for all instances while they are
  /// running. launch-before-terminate - Spot Fleet launches a new replacement
  /// Spot Instance when a rebalance notification is emitted for an existing
  /// Spot Instance in the fleet, and then, after a delay that you specify (in
  /// TerminationDelay ), terminates the instances that received a rebalance
